<node id="กรมศิลปากร">
  <data key="d0">กรมศิลปากร</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Department of Fine Arts, known in Thai as กรมศิลปากร, is a government agency in Thailand dedicated to the management and preservation of the country’s cultural heritage and historical artifacts. Its responsibilities encompass a wide range of duties related to art, culture, and history, including the oversight and maintenance of museums, historical sites, and national archival materials.

As the primary authority on cultural affairs in Thailand, กรมศิลปากร is tasked with preserving and managing the nation’s art and cultural heritage, ensuring that significant historical records are maintained in accordance with legal requirements. This includes the careful documentation and archiving of materials, as well as the evaluation of documents deemed for destruction, safeguarding valuable insights into Thailand's cultural past.

Moreover, the department plays a crucial role in managing national historic archives and is involved in the preservation of artistic works and artifacts, enhancing public access to the nation's heritage. Through these efforts, กรมศิลปากร contributes to the broader understanding and appreciation of Thai culture and history, acting as a vital custodian of the nation’s cultural legacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-24ac77f7076fc10b9cb95f7b3b0d316c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-24ac77f7076fc10b9cb95f7b3b0d316c-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-24ac77f7076fc10b9cb95f7b3b0d316c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ceedf5011eea7c7360657197d99b802c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-031</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ48.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ระเบียบ64.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1788999857</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="สํานักหอจดหมายเหตุแหงชาติ">
  <data key="d0">สํานักหอจดหมายเหตุแหงชาติ</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">หน่วยงานที่มีหน้าที่ดูแลและเก็บรักษาเอกสารและข้อมูลทางประวัติศาสตร์ของประเทศไทย&lt;SEP&gt;The National Archives Office, an agency responsible for managing public records and historical documents in Thailand, including archives and documentation related to various governmental activities and public records retention.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-24ac77f7076fc10b9cb95f7b3b0d316c-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-24ac77f7076fc10b9cb95f7b3b0d316c-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ48.pdf</data>
