  <data key="d0">สารบรรณกลาง</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity refers to the central registry responsible for managing correspondence and official documents within the government body.&lt;SEP&gt;The central document management unit within an organization tasked with handling administrative correspondence and records.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ceedf5011eea7c7360657197d99b802c-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-016</data>
