  <data key="d0">กระดาษตราครุฑ</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific type of official paper used for legal and government documents in Thai culture.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific type of paper used for official documents, distinguished by a royal emblem.&lt;SEP&gt;An official paper used for governmental documents, marked with a seal that denotes its authenticity and official status.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific type of paper used for official documents, characterized by a watermark that features the Garuda emblem, signifying authenticity and governmental use.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-029</data>
