  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A physical mark or stamp used to acknowledge receipt of written works according to the defined standards.&lt;SEP&gt;A stamp used to mark received documents, typically rectangular and used for official record-keeping, to log received correspondence.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-029</data>
