  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">การเก็บหนังสือ refers to the procedure and regulations for storing official documents and records in Thailand, ensuring proper management and retention of documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1788999852</data>
