  <data key="d2">A government agency responsible for storing documents that have completed their operational or verification period according to legal and procedural guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
