  <data key="d0">บัญชีสงมอบหนังสือครบ ๒๕ ป</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">บัญชีสงมอบหนังสือครบ ๒๕ ป refers to a mandatory accounting document that government agencies in Thailand must prepare when submitting records to the national archive, specifically for materials retained for a period of 25 years.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1788999852</data>
