<edge source="กรมศิลปากร" target="หนังสือ">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The organization is responsible for preserving and managing historical documents as per legal requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fine Arts Department evaluates the documents designated for destruction.&lt;SEP&gt;กรมศิลปากร manages the preservation and disposal of various written works, such as documents and reports.</data>
  <data key="d9">evaluates,manages,preserves</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-027</data>
  <data key="d11">ระเบียบ26.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1788999857</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="กรมศิลปากร" target="กองจดหมายเหตุแหงชาติ">
  <data key="d7">4.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Department of Fine Arts inspects and manages the documents deposited at the National Archives Office.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization collaborates with the national archives in preserving and managing historical documents.&lt;SEP&gt;กองจดหมายเหตุแหงชาติ functions as a division under the supervision of theกรมศิลปากร.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Bureau of Art and Culture oversees the National Archives.</data>
  <data key="d9">collaborates,inspects,manages,oversees,oversight,supervises</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-06774247da1722a2a4938aa36ec173a4-chunk-031</data>
